      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::rubric_mechanisms::003::9cea05c012"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment produces a homogeneous distribution of δ-lamellae and γ″ particles within grains.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::rubric_mechanisms::003::9cea05c012"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intragranular distribution of precipitates, rather than grain-boundary precipitation, prevents intergranular embrittlement.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::rubric_mechanisms::003::9cea05c012"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The homogeneous precipitate distribution allows dislocation transmission and relieves stress concentrations.",
