        "PMC10213035::rubric_mechanisms::000::0acd88f470"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent nanoprecipitate interfaces facilitate dislocation transmission, relieve stress concentrations, and suppress premature cracking.",
